   "author": "Matt Logan",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mcdlogan_venturecapital-ai-climatetech-activity-7517010333648158720-COmJ",
   "text": "Thanks for having me, Augustin Sayer!\n\nOn the point below, there\u2019s more than one way to win in venture. But at Earthshot Ventures  we\u2019re focused on the companies with the most absolute upside, which sometimes means owning a smaller percentage when we believe a company can run forever.\n\nAlso, while our initial Etched and KoBold Metals checks didn\u2019t buy 10% ownership, they were the two biggest initial checks we\u2019d written at the time. We\u2019re not spraying and praying!\n\nLastly, I think this was the first time I\u2019ve talked publicly about my outbound sourcing strategy. Founders, answer my emails please. Gavin Uberti, Kurt House, Alex Haro, and Varun Sivaram did. If you do, perhaps your company too wi",
